<Mod id="f6859d5b-50bf-4a7e-b5d3-bdc2d6e69392" version="7">
  <Properties>
    <Name>Cool Wacky Civs 2</Name>
    <Teaser>An endless city, a republic on the wing, and a living legend.</Teaser>
    <Description>The Boundless City, The Republic of Pigeons, and The Indigo Champion led by Trainer Red. Train an elite Champion Team, bond with Pokémon Aces and journey to Mt. Silver. Requires BNW and Community Patch v151. See the included civilization guides.</Description>
